                      "content": "1. Send a distinguishable complete POST request through rendered controls.\n\n2. Replace the active editor with another draft, then select the original History entry.\n\n3. Mouse click and Enter / Space run the same replay command.\n\n4. Method, URL, Params, Headers, Authorization, and typed Body restore into the active editor.\n\n5. Click Send immediately without Enter, Tab, blur, Add, or submit-time backfill.\n\n6. HTTPBingo receives the same complete Request and History adds a new replay entry without mutating the original.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.3,
                      "fontFamily": "$fontBody",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
