                      "fill": "$text",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• POST + full URL + existing=1&tag=rust restore exactly.\n\n• Current-session runtime replay restores X-Replay, Bearer authorization, and typed JSON to ViewModel + rendered controls.\n\n• Recovered #127/#131 replay uses a sanitized snapshot: Authorization and Cookie are absent.\n\n• Loading either snapshot resets ResponseState to NotSent and preserves unrelated History.\n\n• Original entry unchanged; Replay #1 is a new independent entry with 200 OK.\n\n• Mouse and keyboard selection converge on one application-service command; controls own no replay model.",
